{"seq":2,"slug":"constraint-relaxation","title":"约束放宽","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-matchmaking-systems/matching/constraint-relaxation","wordCount":1544,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"约束放宽\">约束放宽</h1><p>没有任何玩家能在入队的第一秒就找到评分、延迟、地区都完美吻合的对手——尤其在深夜或冷门模式里，那样的对手可能根本不在线。约束放宽（constraint relaxation）是匹配系统对这个现实的回应：与其死等一个或许永不出现的理想对局，不如随着等待时间的推移，一点一点地放低门槛，直到找到一个「够好」的局。它是把基础章那条质量-等待成本曲线真正写进代码的地方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>约束放宽（constraint relaxation）是匹配系统对「理想对手可能根本不在线」这一现实的回应：与其死等一个或许永不出现的完美对局，不如随等待时间推移逐步放低门槛。它的核心是一个随时间递增的门槛函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta(t) = \\theta_0 + r \\cdot t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是初始容忍度、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是放宽速率，等价于让成本函数里的等待惩罚 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 随时间显性化。放宽不是单一旋钮，而是一组约束按优先级依次松开：先松哪个、后松哪个，直接体现游戏的目标取向（连接优先者死守延迟，技能优先者更早牺牲均势）。放宽曲线有线性、阶梯、凸、自适应等形状，自适应按实时池规模动态调速最优但最复杂。放宽必须设硬上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 并兜底，且会带来污染评分、高分玩家长期不均势等公平副作用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么必须放宽\">为什么必须放宽</h2><p>固定门槛的匹配有个致命缺陷：如果初始门槛设得严，低活跃时段会有人无限期排队；如果设得松，高峰期又会牺牲质量。放宽用一条随时间变化的门槛同时解决两头——开局严格（高峰期此时池子大，容易满足），随等待逐步松动（深夜此时池子小，必须松手才成局）。门槛 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 因此是入队时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的递增函数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta(t) = \\theta_0 + r \\cdot t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是初始容忍的评分差，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是放宽速率。这条线性放宽是最常见的起步形态，等价于让基础章成本函数里的等待惩罚 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 随时间显性化——等得越久，系统越愿意用质量换成局。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>等待时长</th>\n<th>接受的评分差</th>\n<th>接受的延迟</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>初始</td>\n<td>0-10s</td>\n<td>很窄（如 ±50）</td>\n<td>很严（如 30ms）</td>\n<td>只要最均势的局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>放宽中</td>\n<td>10-40s</td>\n<td>渐宽（如 ±150）</td>\n<td>渐松（如 60ms）</td>\n<td>牺牲一点质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兜底</td>\n<td>&gt;60s</td>\n<td>很宽（如 ±400）</td>\n<td>很松（如 120ms）</td>\n<td>优先成局而非质量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"放宽哪些约束-按什么顺序\">放宽哪些约束，按什么顺序</h2><p>放宽不是单一旋钮，而是一组约束按优先级依次松开。先松哪个、后松哪个，直接体现了游戏的目标取向——这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/matchmaking-goals\">匹配目标谱系</a> 的落地：连接优先的游戏会把延迟约束放到最后才松，技能优先的游戏则更早牺牲均势。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[入队, 全约束最严] --&gt; B{等待 t 超过阈值?}&#10;  B -- 否 --&gt; C[维持当前门槛搜索]&#10;  C --&gt; B&#10;  B -- 是 --&gt; D[按优先级松开下一个约束]&#10;  D --&gt; E{先松技能还是先松延迟}&#10;  E -- 技能优先策略 --&gt; F[先放宽延迟, 死守均势]&#10;  E -- 连接优先策略 --&gt; G[先放宽评分差, 死守低 ping]&#10;  F --&gt; H[重新搜索]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I{找到合格局?}&#10;  I -- 是 --&gt; J[成局]&#10;  I -- 否, 触达兜底 --&gt; K[兜底成局或提示稍后]\">flowchart TD\n  A[入队, 全约束最严] --&gt; B{等待 t 超过阈值?}\n  B -- 否 --&gt; C[维持当前门槛搜索]\n  C --&gt; B\n  B -- 是 --&gt; D[按优先级松开下一个约束]\n  D --&gt; E{先松技能还是先松延迟}\n  E -- 技能优先策略 --&gt; F[先放宽延迟, 死守均势]\n  E -- 连接优先策略 --&gt; G[先放宽评分差, 死守低 ping]\n  F --&gt; H[重新搜索]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I{找到合格局?}\n  I -- 是 --&gt; J[成局]\n  I -- 否, 触达兜底 --&gt; K[兜底成局或提示稍后]</pre><p>约束的放宽顺序往往是：先放宽评分差（多数玩家对质量的容忍高于对久等的容忍），再放宽延迟，最后才动地区/模式这类硬约束。评分差能放宽的另一个依据来自评级的不确定性——<a href=\"../rating/glicko-uncertainty\">Glicko 与不确定性</a> 里 RD 大的玩家本就不该被严格匹配，对他们放宽几乎无损，对 RD 小的老手则要谨慎。</p>\n<h2 id=\"放宽曲线的形状\">放宽曲线的形状</h2><p>线性放宽简单但未必最优。实践中常用几种曲线形状，各有取舍。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>曲线形状</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>匀速放宽</td>\n<td>可预测、易调</td>\n<td>高峰期放太快、深夜放太慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阶梯</td>\n<td>到点跳一档</td>\n<td>实现简单、边界清晰</td>\n<td>跳变处质量突降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指数/凸</td>\n<td>先慢后快</td>\n<td>给均势局更多机会</td>\n<td>长尾等待可能很久</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自适应</td>\n<td>按当前池规模动态调</td>\n<td>高峰严、深夜松</td>\n<td>实现复杂、需实时监控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最理想的是自适应放宽：系统实时观测当前候选池规模与历史等待分布，动态决定放宽速率——池子大时慢放（反正容易满足），池子小时快放（不松就永远凑不齐）。这需要把实时的池子指标喂进决策，而这些指标的采集与定义属于 <a href=\"../practice/matchmaking-health\">匹配健康度指标</a> 与遥测体系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"放宽的兜底与公平风险\">放宽的兜底与公平风险</h2><p>放宽必须有终点，否则极端情况下会把天差地别的人凑到一起。系统通常设一个硬上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，触达后要么兜底成局（接受一个不太均势的对局，总比无限等好），要么提示玩家「当前人数较少，请稍后」。</p>\n<p>放宽还藏着一个公平陷阱：一个评分被放宽到极限才匹配上的玩家，很可能是被「拉高」或「拉低」进局的，这会污染评分更新。更隐蔽的是，长期被迫大幅放宽的高分玩家，体验上等同于「永远在打不均势的局」。这些放宽带来的公平副作用，需要在健康度里被监控，也与小号问题交织——小号正是利用放宽与冷启动的窗口去碾压新手，详见 <a href=\"../practice/fairness-smurfing\">公平与小号</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>放宽用随等待递增的门槛，同时解决高峰期保质量与深夜保成局两头的矛盾。</li>\n<li>约束按优先级依次松开，先松哪个体现游戏目标取向（连接优先 vs 技能优先）。</li>\n<li>放宽曲线有线性、阶梯、凸、自适应等形状，自适应按实时池规模动态调速最优但最复杂。</li>\n<li>放宽必须设硬上限并兜底，且会带来污染评分、高分玩家长期不均势等公平副作用，需被监控。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>放宽所落地的质量-等待成本曲线，见 <a href=\"../foundations/matchmaking-tradeoffs\">匹配质量与等待权衡</a>。</li>\n<li>放宽建立在分桶之上（先有桶才谈跨桶溢出），见 <a href=\"queue-bucketing\">队列与分桶</a>。</li>\n<li>按 RD 决定该不该放宽，见 <a href=\"../rating/glicko-uncertainty\">Glicko 与不确定性</a>。</li>\n<li>自适应放宽所需的实时池指标，见 <a href=\"../practice/matchmaking-health\">匹配健康度指标</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"约束放宽","id":"约束放宽"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么必须放宽","id":"为什么必须放宽"},{"level":2,"text":"放宽哪些约束，按什么顺序","id":"放宽哪些约束-按什么顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"放宽曲线的形状","id":"放宽曲线的形状"},{"level":2,"text":"放宽的兜底与公平风险","id":"放宽的兜底与公平风险"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"队列与分桶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-matchmaking-systems/matching/queue-bucketing"},"next":{"title":"组队与角色匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-matchmaking-systems/matching/party-role-matching"}}